{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19755","headline":"列女操 · 孟郊","name":"列女操","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梧桐相待老，鸳鸯会双死。\n贞女贵狥夫，舍生亦如此。\n波澜誓不起，妾心井中水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗 · 乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「列女操」条，撰者滕伟明、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"霍松林"}